    },
    {
      "Kolmogorov-Smirnov test compared freezing temperature distributions of two samples.": "Kolmogorov-Smirnov test"
    },
    {
      "The Asymptote VIA freezer accommodated up to 48 x 1 mL cryovials.": "48 1 mL cryovials"
    },
    {
